menu "Retro-Go"
    config RG_DISPLAY_ACTIVITY
        bool "Track display task activity (rg_display_is_active)"
        default n
        help
            Adds rg_display_is_active(): true from rg_display_submit() until
            the display task has finished that frame, lcd_sync() included
            (rg_display_is_busy() keeps reporting only a non-empty queue).
            Costs one increment per submitted frame and one store per
            displayed frame. Off by default; an application that needs it
            selects it (gbsp's hybrid render does).
    config RG_AUDIO_I2S_TELEMETRY
        bool "Measure I2S DMA queue behaviour"
        default n
        help
            Diagnostic-only counters for the legacy I2S driver: completed and
            replayed DMA buffers, frames accepted, time spent specifically in
            i2s_write(), event backlog and sample-rate reset epochs. Off by
            default; applications that need transition traces select it.
    config RG_AUDIO_I2S_LIVE_RATE
        bool "Update the ESP32-S3 external-I2S clock without restarting DMA"
        default n
        depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
        help
            Updates only the TX clock divider for the external stereo 16-bit
            I2S path. The legacy i2s_set_sample_rates() implementation stops
            and restarts the channel even when the DMA layout is unchanged;
            this option preserves the queued descriptors across rate changes.
            Applications must opt in. Other audio devices retain the legacy
            driver operation.
    config RG_AUDIO_I2S_AUTO_CLEAR
        bool "Clear empty I2S TX DMA descriptors to silence"
        default n
        help
            Enables the legacy driver's tx_desc_auto_clear option. When the
            producer cannot refill a TX descriptor in time, the completed
            descriptor is cleared instead of replaying stale samples. This
            replaces the repeated-buffer buzz with digital silence. Apps must
            opt in; the default behaviour of every other core is unchanged.
endmenu
